## Graphical Abstract
A series of semiconductive CoNi bimetal–organic frameworks $(\mathrm{Co_{x}N i_{3-x}(H A B)_{2}}$
MOFs) were explored as the potential of the MOFs as efficient multifunctional electrocatalysts for the non-Pt methanol oxidation reaction (MOR) and overall water splitting in alkaline medium.
